get.description:
Get the list of AirMediaReceiver connected to the Freebox Server

## Example request
```http
GET /api/v4/airmedia/receivers/ HTTP/1.1
Host: mafreebox.freebox.fr
```

## Example response
```json
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
   success: true,
   result: [
      {
         capabilities: {
            photo: true,
            screen: false,
            audio: true,
            video: true
         },
         name: "Freebox Player",
         password_protected: true
      },
      {
         capabilities: {
            photo: false,
            screen: false,
            audio: true,
            video: false
         },
         name: "Freebox Server",
         password_protected: false
      }
   ]
}
```

