post.description:
Get RRD stats for the requested rrd database (net, temp, dsl or switch), optionally restricted to a date range, a precision factor and a subset of fields. Returns date_start, date_end and a data array of {time, <field>: value} entries.

## Example request
```http
POST /api/v4/rrd/ HTTP/1.1
Host: mafreebox.freebox.fr

{
   "db": "temp",
   "fields": [ "temp1" ],
   "precision": 10
}
```

## Example response
```json
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
    "success": true,
    "result": {
        "date_start": 1353048060,
        "data": [
            {
                "temp1": 540,
                "time": 1353060840
            },
            {
                "temp1": 545,
                "time": 1353060900
            },
            [ ... ],
            {
                "temp1": 540,
                "time": 1353069600
            }
        ],
        "date_end": 1353069660
    }
}
```

